Hi!  To fix this you need to source the updated cladoRcpp package file (*after* doing library(BioGeoBEARS)), it is this command:

source("http://phylo.wdfiles.com/local--files/biogeobears/cladoRcpp.R") # (needed now that traits model added; source FIRST!)

(In general, make sure you source everything as listed at http://phylo.wikidot.com/biogeobears#script )

Cheers!
Nick

